## Frontend (Vite) environment variables
#
# In development, the app calls the API via `/api` (Vite dev-server proxy).
# Set `VITE_API_TARGET` to wherever your Fastify API is listening.
#
# Example:
# - Default API: VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3100
# Keep `VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api` in development so requests use the Vite proxy.

VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:3100
# Secure default: Vite binds only to loopback. For trusted LAN device testing,
# explicitly set a bind address and a comma-separated host allowlist locally.
VITE_DEV_HOST=127.0.0.1
VITE_ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1
